{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Because Infinite Power is Infinitely Fun</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594040/extras/5b1161738c951ca2917b2a413e20e415.poster.avif?t=1763471769\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594040/extras/5b1161738c951ca2917b2a413e20e415.webm?t=1763471769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594040/extras/5b1161738c951ca2917b2a413e20e415.mp4?t=1763471769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">What if a single key could open up an entire 400 square kilometer driving game universe? You\u2019ve probably thought about it. The seemingly infinite number of what-ifs inside your head after pouring countless hours into racing, open world and building games. Wreckreation is exactly that. Developed by Three Fields Entertainment, the UK-based team comprised of veteran arcade racing game developers, Wreckreation finally hands you the keys to your own World. This will be a World that you can decorate and personalize, either alone or in collaboration with your friends online. A place of your own where you can continually strive to outrace, out-stunt or even out-crash yourself and others with courses, tracks and game modes designed by you \u2013 or your friends \u2013 but yours will probably be better. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594040/extras/ebd8fc3d5cf66d2bb6d283889fd289a3.poster.avif?t=1763471769\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594040/extras/ebd8fc3d5cf66d2bb6d283889fd289a3.webm?t=1763471769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594040/extras/ebd8fc3d5cf66d2bb6d283889fd289a3.mp4?t=1763471769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mix Up The Leaderboards \u2013 Set records in eight different ways wherever and whenever you drive on every street in your world: Drift, Air, Near Miss, Stunt, and the more traditional, Time.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mix My World \u2013 A huge, open world that is yours to discover and design. Place jumps, loops, half pipes, moving obstacles, and more almost anywhere in your world. </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mix My Car \u2013 Paint colors, finishes, wheels, boost flames, engine sounds, glass colors, tires, you name it, you can customize it. Everything will be available from the beginning.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mix My Music \u2013 Radio stations are the unsung heroes of racing games. Listen to 16 different channels!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mix All Modes \u2013 Whether it\u2019s a simple race or a team stunt event where catching the most air and landing the first barrel roll will bring points to your team, you control the gameplay in your world.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mix It All \u2013 In the world you can be a god! Control the weather, time of day and the traffic! Find vacancies and build structures that impact your world beyond their foundation. The power is yours.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594040/extras/2885184b307352b89bff430d4bccdc66.poster.avif?t=1763471769\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594040/extras/2885184b307352b89bff430d4bccdc66.webm?t=1763471769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594040/extras/2885184b307352b89bff430d4bccdc66.mp4?t=1763471769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Accidents Will Happen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1594040/8bd43c32d25225ca87d88f612f48392611a48219.jpg"},{"name":"Everything in it's Place","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1594040/a294916bb8191beb393af5e3186cdb44f11f89c3.jpg"},{"name":"Board Stupid","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1594040/23b1d0726e7bbef3656b6e9928983c6573c01681.jpg"},{"name":"Brought To You By","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1594040/9f0bf9b5a2434ec90958668552f2f2eb65028a6d.jpg"},{"name":"Cake Walk","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1594040/4acbd0844f761e1818e259132be300d98cef626b.jpg"},{"name":"Calm Down Dear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1594040/fb1123f21deef9d5e80b0ccac528fb6bf30c52b5.jpg"},{"name":"Cheer Up Sleepy Jean","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1594040/02924a20036cd680005ccf629bf3e60a9b00a537.jpg"},{"name":"Cobwebs Blown","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1594040/c800c5be9ce3471a4dece85d2679e761b424dcc0.jpg"},{"name":"Found What I'm Looking For","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1594040/8f44c916b2357c390a4f90820c8411c8590ee57f.jpg"},{"name":"Dedicated","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1594040/bb8690e801cfec2a74c17463b28b87d18ffae402.jpg"}],"total":46},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1594040?t=1763471769","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594040/d9a2bb614bd3041c9938af4d608d9c3b32e73dbf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763471769","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594040/feb45e200df8d59b14b1ca087c6faa340b794706/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763471769","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594040/feb45e200df8d59b14b1ca087c6faa340b794706/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763471769","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Because Infinite Power is Infinitely Fun</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594040/extras/5b1161738c951ca2917b2a413e20e415.poster.avif?t=1763471769\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594040/extras/5b1161738c951ca2917b2a413e20e415.webm?t=1763471769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594040/extras/5b1161738c951ca2917b2a413e20e415.mp4?t=1763471769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">What if a single key could open up an entire 400 square kilometer driving game universe? You\u2019ve probably thought about it. The seemingly infinite number of what-ifs inside your head after pouring countless hours into racing, open world and building games. Wreckreation is exactly that. Developed by Three Fields Entertainment, the UK-based team comprised of veteran arcade racing game developers, Wreckreation finally hands you the keys to your own World. This will be a World that you can decorate and personalize, either alone or in collaboration with your friends online. A place of your own where you can continually strive to outrace, out-stunt or even out-crash yourself and others with courses, tracks and game modes designed by you \u2013 or your friends \u2013 but yours will probably be better. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594040/extras/ebd8fc3d5cf66d2bb6d283889fd289a3.poster.avif?t=1763471769\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594040/extras/ebd8fc3d5cf66d2bb6d283889fd289a3.webm?t=1763471769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594040/extras/ebd8fc3d5cf66d2bb6d283889fd289a3.mp4?t=1763471769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mix Up The Leaderboards \u2013 Set records in eight different ways wherever and whenever you drive on every street in your world: Drift, Air, Near Miss, Stunt, and the more traditional, Time.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mix My World \u2013 A huge, open world that is yours to discover and design. Place jumps, loops, half pipes, moving obstacles, and more almost anywhere in your world. </strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mix My Car \u2013 Paint colors, finishes, wheels, boost flames, engine sounds, glass colors, tires, you name it, you can customize it. Everything will be available from the beginning.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mix My Music \u2013 Radio stations are the unsung heroes of racing games. Listen to 16 different channels!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mix All Modes \u2013 Whether it\u2019s a simple race or a team stunt event where catching the most air and landing the first barrel roll will bring points to your team, you control the gameplay in your world.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mix It All \u2013 In the world you can be a god! Control the weather, time of day and the traffic! Find vacancies and build structures that impact your world beyond their foundation. The power is yours.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594040/extras/2885184b307352b89bff430d4bccdc66.poster.avif?t=1763471769\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594040/extras/2885184b307352b89bff430d4bccdc66.webm?t=1763471769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594040/extras/2885184b307352b89bff430d4bccdc66.mp4?t=1763471769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Three Fields Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594040/ff89