,"rating":"e10"},"kgrb":{"rating":"all"},"oflc":{"descriptors":"Very mild themes, online interactivity","rating":"g"},"pegi":{"descriptors":"Bad Language\r\nSex","rating":"12"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Fantasy-Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"},"usk":{"descriptors":"Erh\u00f6hte Kommunikationsrisiken\r\nChats","rating":"16","rating_id":"56999/25"}},"recommendations":{"total":272},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"28 Oct, 2025"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cIf you\u2019re a fan of old-school Burnout, Wreckreation is a must-play.\u201d<br>8.5/10 \u2013 CGMagazine<br><br>\u201cIf you love the freedom and chaos of open-world driving but hate being bogged down by plotlines or filler, Wreckreation is exactly what you\u2019ve been waiting for. The game handles driving pretty well, offers a fair amount of activities that embrace the chaos of virtual driving, and lets you build your own tracks, and somehow manages to do all of it seamlessly, with no menus or load times in between.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Try Hard Guides<br><br>\u201cIn conclusion, Wreckreation is the ultimate fun racing game. Even though it uses the same codes as Burnout, it manages to stand out for its Live Mix mode, which lets you create crazy races and transform your map into an even crazier playground. It's been a long time since we've had so much fun on the road without having to think too hard. And this Burnout-Like is just what we've been needed for years.\u201d<br>10/10 \u2013 Couple of Gamer<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594040/5c961a2c3b1966c7e006cdeade48960e1613af1d/ss_5c961a2c3b1966c7e006cdeade48960e1613af1d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1763471769","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1594040/5c961a2c3b1966c7e006cdeade48960e1613af1d/ss_5c961a2c3b1966c7e006cdeade48960e1613af1d.600x338.jpg?t=1763471769"},{